                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66\">TB-500 appears among lyophilized peptide listings used in laboratory research inventories. View <a href=\"https://www.biopentra.eu/product/tb-500/\" style=\"color:#1F5FAE;text-decoration:none\">TB-500</a> for product information.</p>",
                                        "text_color": "#3D4F66"
