                                    "settings": {
                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66\">This dual-peptide listing is provided in lyophilized form where noted on the product page. See <a href=\"https://www.biopentra.eu/product/cjc-1295-no-dac-ipa/\" style=\"color:#1F5FAE;text-decoration:none\">CJC-1295 No DAC + IPA</a> for catalog context.</p>",
