                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66\">MOTS-C is listed as a lyophilized research material with variation options on its product page. Review <a href=\"https://www.biopentra.eu/product/mots-c/\" style=\"color:#1F5FAE;text-decoration:none\">MOTS-C</a> for current availability.</p>",
                                        "text_color": "#3D4F66"
                                    },
                                    "elements": []
                                },
                                {
