                                        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3D4F66\">Retatrutide is among metabolic research peptides commonly supplied in lyophilized presentation. See <a href=\"https://www.biopentra.eu/product/triple-g/\" style=\"color:#1F5FAE;text-decoration:none\">Triple G (Retatrutide)</a> for strengths and listing notes.</p>",
